     <p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: center; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28px; font-size: 19px;">招贤令</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28px; font-size: 19px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">2</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28px; font-size: 19px;">：团学联干部、干事招聘启事</span></strong></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">为锻炼学生自我教育、自我管理、自我服务的综合能力，同时充分发挥学校与学生之间的桥梁和纽带作用，现拟招聘团学干部（面向高二）、团学干事（面向高一）若干名，具体办法如下：</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">一、招聘条件</span></strong></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">1.</span>思想上进，觉悟较高，各方面积极要求进步。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">2.</span>学习勤奋，成绩良好。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">3.</span>热心团委、学生会工作，有较强的责任心和服务精神。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">4.</span>有较强的集体观念和团队协作精神。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">5.</span>有较强的社会工作能力、人际沟通能力或团委、学生会所需的特长。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">6.</span>密切联系同学，群众基础较好。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">7.</span>高二团学干部需为原高一的团学干事<span style="font-family: Calibri;">/</span>班干部<span style="font-family: Calibri;">/</span>团干部<span style="font-family: Calibri;">/</span>社团骨干等。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">二、招聘部门</span></strong></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; background: rgb(192, 192, 192);">（一）团委</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">1.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">组织部：【部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，副部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">2</span>名，干事<span style="font-family: Calibri;">8</span>名左右】</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">负责协助团员发展、团组织关系转接、团籍档案管理、团支部及团员考核等工作。要求思想觉悟高，为人正派，办事严肃认真，原则性强，组织能力较强。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">2.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">宣传部：【部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，副部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，干事<span style="font-family: Calibri;">6</span>名左右】</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">负责<span style="caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 宋体; text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px;">团校的组织开展工作，</span>协助团委进行团员培训、考核等工作。<span style="caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 宋体; text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px;">要求思想觉悟高，为人正派，办事严肃认真，原则性强，组织能力较强。</span></span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">3.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">实践部：【部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，副部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，干事<span style="font-family: Calibri;">6</span>名左右】</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">负责布置、服务、考核、总结全校各团支部开展的社会实践活动，牵头部分校级实践项目，协助学生报刊的分发工作。要求细致、有耐心，有较强的奉献精神、协调能力、实干精神。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">4.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">纪检部：【部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，副部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，干事<span style="font-family: Calibri;">8</span>名左右】</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">负责校纪校风的维护与纠察，配合学校处室进行大型集会、比赛活动的专项检查与纪律维护。要求为人正派，办事严肃认真，原则性强，能较为从容地应对突发违纪事件。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"> <span style="caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">5.志愿者之家</span></span><span style="caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px;">：【部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，副部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">2</span>名，干事<span style="font-family: Calibri;">8</span>名左右】</span></span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><font face="宋体">负责配合学校各项大型活动的志愿者招募、培训、管理、学分登记等工作。要求有一定组织能力，办事认真严肃。</font></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; background: rgb(192, 192, 192);">（二）学生会</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">1.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">秘书部：【部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，副部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，干事<span style="font-family: Calibri;">6</span>名左右】</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">负责团学联会议纪要，负责学生报刊的分发工作。要求有较强的协调能力、文字编排能力，严谨认真、有较强的档案意识。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">2.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">学习部：【部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，副部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，干事<span style="font-family: Calibri;">6</span>名左右】</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">负责开展知识竞赛、诗词大会、学霸经验分享会等与学习有关的多种活动，助力形成校园优良学风。要求有较强的组织协调能力、自主学习能力。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">3.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">广电部：【部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，副部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，干事<span style="font-family: Calibri;">10</span>名左右】</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">负责运动会广播，制作课间音乐歌单，担任校级大型活动主持等。要求普通话较为标准，敢于表现自我，热爱播音主持。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">4.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">文</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">体</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">部：【部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，副部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，干事</span><span style="line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">名</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">左右</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">，礼仪队<span style="font-family: Calibri;">10</span>名左右】</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">协助学校筹备学校大型文艺</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">体育</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">类活动，负责场务工作，组建并维护礼仪队。要求具备较强的协调能力、实干精神；礼仪队要求身高<span style="font-family: Calibri;">165</span>以上（女）。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">学生权益部：【部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，副部长<span style="font-family: Calibri;">1</span>名，干事<span style="font-family: Calibri;">6</span>名左右】</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">紧密联系同学，协助总务处开展学校食品、住宿等满意度调查，举行食堂超市经理意见反馈会等，维护学生在校生活权益，举办食宿方面的创意活动。要求善于沟通，工作认真细致，乐于帮助、服务他人。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px; background: rgb(192, 192, 192);">（三）社团联合会</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">【副主席<span style="font-family: Calibri;">2</span>名，干事<span style="font-family: Calibri;">8</span>名左右】</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">负责管理社团的成立、废除、换届、活动、财务、调查、考核，规范并协调各个社团的活动开展，牵头组织各社团筹备年度社团联合招新，汇总记录社团的活动事项及活动成果，协助“一中学子”微信公众号运营。要求有较强的统筹管理能力、协作精神，办事细心认真，有较强的多媒体运用能力为佳。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">三、招聘流程</span></strong></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">1.</span>报名：</span><span style="line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 宋体;">个人自主报名，须经家长、班主任同意。报名截止：</span><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong><span style="line-height: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">9<span style="font-family: 宋体;">月</span>14<span style="font-family: 宋体;">日（下周一）</span>17:00</span></strong></span><span style="line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">，将附件竞聘表纸质版（详见附件</span>1<span style="font-family: 宋体;">、</span>2<span style="font-family: 宋体;">）交至</span></span><strong><span style="line-height: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">教学楼</span>2114<span style="font-family: 宋体;">团委</span></span></strong><span style="line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 宋体;">。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">2</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">面试：团委组织审查筛选，确定参加面试的同学名单，并由团委老师和团学联主席团对干部候选人进行面试，产生各部门主要干部对干事候选人进行面试</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">面试时间请留意校园网上的通知。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">3</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">试用考察：干事面试通过者有为期一个月的试用考察，在考察期内需参加校团委会组织的培训。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">4</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">正式录用：试用考察期满，合格者正式录用。</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"> <span style="font-family: Calibri; text-indent: 31.68px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">附件1：绍兴一中团学联干部报名表</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/downloads/xwzx/2026/9/202609071041425199.doc" title="202609071041425199.doc">202609071041425199.doc</a></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri; text-indent: 31.68px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">附件2：绍兴一中团学联干事自（推）荐表</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/downloads/xwzx/2026/9/202609071041539745.doc" title="202609071041539745.doc">202609071041539745.doc</a></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 32px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri; text-indent: 31.68px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span></span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: right; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">共青团绍兴市第一中学委员会</span></p><p style="padding: 0px; margin-top: 0px; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: normal; text-align: right; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 21px; margin-bottom: 20px !important;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">2026</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">年<span style="font-family: Calibri;">9</span>月</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;">7</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 16px;">日</span></p><p>
</p>
    
